msgstr "Dat opliste Teel de List mit Afhangigkeiten tofögen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KComboBox, dependencyAction)
#. +> trunk stable
#: nativeappconfig.ui:254
msgid "Specifies the action to take for the dependencies before starting the executable."
msgstr "Gifft de Akschoon an, de Du för de Afhangigkeiten utföhren wullt, ehr dat Programm opropen warrt"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, dependencyAction)
#. +> trunk stable
#: nativeappconfig.ui:257
msgid "The selected action will be run before the executable is started.  This allows there to be parts of a project, upon which the executable does not directly depend, to be built and/or installed before running the application."
msgstr "De utsöchte Akschoon warrt utföhrt, ehr dat Programm opropen warrt. So laat sik Projektdelen oder Deelprojekten, vun de dat Programm nich direktemang afhangen deit, buen oder installeren, ehr dat Programm opropen warrt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, dependencyAction)
#. +> trunk stable
#: nativeappconfig.ui:264
msgid "Do Nothing"
msgstr "Nix doon"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, dependencyAction)
#. +> trunk stable
#: nativeappconfig.ui:269
msgid "Build"
msgstr "Buen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, dependencyAction)
#. +> trunk stable
#: nativeappconfig.ui:274
msgid "Build and Install"
msgstr "Buen un installeren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, dependencyAction)
#. +> trunk stable
#: nativeappconfig.ui:279
msgid "Build and Install (as Superuser)"
msgstr "Buen un installeren (as Systeempleger)"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_8)
#. +> trunk stable
#: nativeappconfig.ui:287
msgid "Action:"
msgstr "Akschoon:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KListWidget, dependencies)
#. +> trunk stable
#: nativeappconfig.ui:300
msgid "List of indirect dependent targets."
msgstr "List mit indirekte Telen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KListWidget, dependencies)
#. +> trunk stable
#: nativeappconfig.ui:303
msgid "This list should contain targets that the application does not directly depend on, but for which an action needs to be taken before running the application."
msgstr "Disse List bargt Telen, vun de dat Programm nich direktemang afhangt, man för de en Akschoon noot deit, ehr dat Programm utföhrt warrt."

